  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">No. <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-node-2\"><strong id=\"\">Validator nodes</strong></a> operated by <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-foundation-and-its-group-of-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Tokens (Jersey) Limited</strong></a>, which is a subsidiary of the <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-foundation-and-its-group-of-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Foundation</strong></a>, are intended to be configured only to allow delegation from Radix Tokens (Jersey) Limited itself. This is to ensure that our nodes cannot draw stake away from <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-community\"><strong id=\"\">community</strong></a>-run nodes.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-foundations-policy-on-staking-node-running\"><strong id=\"\">What is the Radix Foundation’s policy on staking &amp; node-running?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-the-radix-foundation-operate-validator-nodes\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation operate validator nodes?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-the-radix-foundation-stake-its-own-xrd-holdings-to-which-validators\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation stake its own XRD holdings? To which validators?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-radix-receive-incentive-rewards-from-staking-and-validator-node-running-2\"><strong id=\"\">Does the Radix Foundation receive incentive rewards from staking and validator node-running?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/will-radix-operated-validator-nodes-accept-delegated-stake-from-the-community-2\"><strong id=\"\">Do validator nodes operated by the Radix Foundation accept delegated stake from the community?</strong></a></li></ul><p id=\"\">‍</p>",
